    "excerpt": "Over Two Decades of Helping the Mid-South Recycle Better",
    "readMins": 2,
    "img": "blog/norton-equipment-company-celebrates-21-years-in-business",
    "body": "<p><strong>Over Two Decades of Helping the Mid-South Recycle Better</strong></p>\n<p>Byhalia, MS, United States - April 12, 2018 /CMG/ , Founded in March 1997, <a href=\"/\">Norton Equipment Company</a>(NEC) recently reached a major milestone, celebrating 21 years in business. For more than two decades, NEC has provided and serviced recycling equipment across the Mid South in the states of Arkansas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Tennessee.</p>\n<p>Located in Byhalia, Mississippi, NEC’s mission is to help the Mid-South recycle better. They make this mission a reality by offering a number of services including equipment removal, transport, and installation, service, repair, and parts, preventive maintenance, and more.</p>\n<p>Organizations work with NEC to install new recycling equipment, keep existing equipment up and running, and make repairs as required. For 21 years, NEC has provided rapid installation, services, and repairs to keep downtime at a minimum for their customers. In search of used recycling equipment? They have access to many <a href=\"/balers-recycling/used-balers/\">\"recently loved\" pieces of equipment</a> also.</p>\n<p>NEC looks forward to another 21 years of helping the Mid-South recycle better and protect the environment. To learn more about NEC or if you would like some information about how they can help your business, <a href=\"/contact/\">contact them here.</a></p>\n<h2>About Norton Equipment Company:</h2>\n<p>Norton Equipment Co. is known in the Mid-South for providing quality sales and service of recycling equipment in Arkansas, Louisiana, Mississippi and Tennessee. NEC represents several major manufacturers of recycling equipment, including Max-Pak balers, Hustler conveyors, Norton Equipment also has an ever changing inventory of used balers and other recycling equipment. We stock replacement parts, wire and oil for the equipment listed above. We buy and sell balers and conveyor systems.</p>\n<p>Contact Info:<br/> Name: Kathy Norton<br/> Organization: Norton Equipment Company<br/> Address: 60 Amy Ln Byhalia, MS 38611<br/> Phone: (662) 838-7900</p>",
