    "excerpt": "Considering a new baler? Before you invest the big bucks, consider the alternative: a Norton-refurbished baler delivered in a fraction of the time at a fraction of the cost, while still guaranteeing the same efficiency a",
    "readMins": 2,
    "img": "blog/4-benefits-to-buying-a-refurbished-baler",
    "body": "<p>Considering a new <a href=\"/balers-recycling/\">baler</a>? Before you invest the big bucks, consider the alternative: a <a href=\"/balers-recycling/used-balers/\">Norton-refurbished baler</a> delivered in a fraction of the time at a fraction of the cost, while still guaranteeing the same efficiency and delivery you’d expect from a brand new baler.</p>\n<p>Sounds pretty good, right? And the best part? That’s just the tip of the iceberg. When you opt for a refurbished baler, you’re getting a host of production-side benefits, including:</p>\n<h2>#1. Quicker Turnaround Times<br/></h2>\n<p>It takes 16-18 weeks on average to get a new baler ordered and installed. Who has that kind of time? With Norton-refurbished balers, your lead time will be just three to four weeks, helping you get back up and running, or increase your speed and outputs, in less time.</p>\n<h3>#2. Comprehensive Refurbishing<br/></h3>\n<p>We know, some companies only refurbish a few parts and resell the baler to an unsuspecting buyer. At Norton, we’re committed to delivering powerhouse equipment that exceeds your expectations, and that means balers that are completely refurbished all the way down to the base frame. It’s the only way to ensure you’re getting the best value for your investment, and that’s something we never skimp on.</p>\n<h2>#3. Complete Baler Servicing<br/></h2>\n<p>Baler need a repair? Having performance issues? Need some standard maintenance? With <a href=\"/services/compactor-repair/\">local servicing</a> for all refurbished balers, an expert can be at your facility anywhere in our 100-mile ring around Memphis, from Jonesboro to Jackson to Tupelo, usually within a day or two. That means less down time and more baling, and that’s a win/win.</p>\n<p>Each refurbished baler comes complete with a rock solid warranty backed by the expert team at Norton Equipment Co. If your baler isn’t what you needed, wanted or expected, get in touch and we’ll make it right.</p>\n<p>Ready for refurbished? <a href=\"/contact/\">Get in touch</a> to learn more about Norton Equipment Co’s extensive line of refurbished balers.</p>",
